# Component Template

Purpose:
  Template for reusable UI/logic components.

Owns: templates\_sdd\project\component.template.sdd
Schema:
  id: COMP-XXX
  name: <component name>
  module: MOD-XXX
  owner: <team or agent>

  purpose: <one line>

  type: ui|logic|shared

  dependencies:
    - COMP-XXX

  files:
    - path/to/file

State: +
